# 2x2x2 supercell of a conventional bcc cell with a0 = 2.826 Angstrom.
# Supercell lattice parameter = 2*a0 = 5.652 Angstrom.
# Replace X by Al, Si, Ga, Ge, etc. as desired.
#
# The four X atoms occupy alternating sites of the body-centred sublattice:
# (1/4,1/4,1/4), (1/4,3/4,3/4), (3/4,1/4,3/4), (3/4,3/4,1/4).
# These four positions form a regular tetrahedron.

